# NIST RMF GRC Lab: Project-Alpha-Portal

A hands-on Governance, Risk, and Compliance (GRC) project simulating the end-to-end implementation of the **NIST Risk Management Framework (RMF - SP 800-37 Rev. 2)** for a mock critical infrastructure application.

## 🎯 Objective
The purpose of this lab is to bridge theoretical compliance frameworks with real-world execution. It demonstrates how to take a system through categorization, control selection, implementation assessment, remediation tracking (POA&M), authorization, and continuous monitoring.

---

## 🏛️ System Overview
* **System Name:** Project-Alpha-Portal
* **System Type:** Customer-facing web application processing sensitive user data and authentication.
* **Framework Baseline:** NIST SP 800-53 Rev. 5 (Moderate Impact Baseline)

